                        question="What counts as a website in the Starter plan?"
                        answer="&lt;p&gt;A website is defined as a unique domain or subdomain managed through the DXP AI platform. Microsites, landing page collections, and portals each count as one. The Professional and Enterprise plans have no website limits.&lt;/p&gt;"/>
